# MeuJudi Sync installer releases are tracked; source code is tracked too.
# Older rule (`/meujudi-cs/*`) used to exclude the source, but it caused
# work to disappear from version control. Removed in favor of explicit
# ignores inside the CS folder (node_modules, dist, etc.) via the local
# .gitignore in MeuJudi-CS/.
# Renamed "MeuJudi CS" -> "MeuJudi Sync" (Fase 11, v0.3.0) — old exe naming
# kept too so historical releases already tracked stay tracked.
!/meujudi-cs/release/MeuJudi-CS-Setup-v*.exe
!/meujudi-cs/release/MeuJudi-Sync-Setup-v*.exe
!/meujudi-cs/release/MeuJudi-Sync-Setup-v*.exe.blockmap
# Chaves privadas e credenciais locais nunca entram no Git.
meujudi-cs/*.private-key.pem
meujudi-cs/*.pem
meujudi-cs/.env*
!meujudi-cs/.env.example

# Root loose assets copied into public/
MeuJudi Icon.png
MeuJudi Logo *.png

